{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Thank you for coming in, Ms. Lenard. My name is Boris Brody. Did you have any trouble finding the office?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Not at all. It's nice to meet you, Mr. Brody.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: You too, Ms. Lenard. Please, take a seat.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Thank you. You have a lovely office.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Thanks. Alright, let's get down to brass tacks. Please, tell me a little bit about yourself, Kristi.<br />", "id": 1, "time": "2000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I graduated from the English program at Harvard University. I took a variety of courses to ensure I developed the skills I needed in addition to gaining a plethora of knowledge.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Great. What were some of the courses you took?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I took a few literature courses, writing and creative writing. I also took quite a few courses in publishing.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Uh huh.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I also took some courses that were more hands-on and I am familiar with many of the leading software packages, particularly <span class=\"italic\">inPrint</span>.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: We use <span class=\"italic\">inPrint</span> for layout here too.<br />", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: And, in my internship at Polygon, I got to apply many of these skills.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Good. So in what ways did you benefit from that experience?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Well, even though my responsibilities as an intern were limited, it was a great opportunity to participate and work with a team of professionals. Occasionally there was a crisis and I had to meet deadlines and deal with heavy workloads.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: I see.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I also had a good working relationship with my boss. We quickly established a good rapport.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: That gives me a good idea of your experience.  Let's move on.<br />", "id": 3, "time": "64500", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn9le16ob06re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about events and experiences related to jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about facts and courses of actions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can participate in interviews.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What mistakes do people usually make in job interviews?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How can these mistakes be corrected?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "How to succeed in a job interview!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents"